# Rust
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# Python
# ``.venv`` (no trailing slash) so a stray symlink is ignored too: a
# ``.venv/``-only pattern does not match a symlink, which is how a
# self-referential ``.venv -> <repo>/.venv`` link once got committed and
# broke ``uv sync`` with "Too many levels of symbolic links".
.venv
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
build/

# Dagster local instance / runtime state
.dagster_home/
dagster_home/
# A cwd-relative Dagster store is a deployment footgun (bridge and daemon are
# separate processes); never commit one.
/storage/
*.sqlite
*.db

# Local / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store

# Coverage
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# Mutation testing output
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
